<view class="page-container">
 <view class="share-header"><text class="eyebrow">创作者 · 模板分享</text><text class="headline">粘贴资料，分享新风格</text><text class="subtitle">让AI整理模板资料，粘贴后自动填入；再上传1–3张实际效果封面，核对后提交审核。</text></view>
 <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="notice">正在读取模板…</view>
 <view class="notice" wx:if="{{hasPublished}}">已有审核版继续展示；这次修改提交并审核通过后，才替换公开版本。</view>
 <view class="notice" wx:if="{{locked}}">当前版本审核中，暂时不可编辑。可在“我的模板”核对或撤回。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{reason}}" class="reason">后台反馈：{{reason}}</view>
 <view class="form-card import-card">
  <text class="section-title">1 · 粘贴AI整理结果</text>
  <text class="hint">先复制指令，和你的原始生成提示词一起发给常用的AI。把AI返回的完整JSON粘贴到这里，会自动填入下方资料。</text>
  <view class="import-tools"><button bindtap="onCopyGuide" disabled="{{busy || loading || copying}}" loading="{{copying}}">{{copying ? '正在复制…' : '复制AI整理指令'}}</button><button class="text-action" bindtap="onShowAiInstruction" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">{{showAiInstruction ? '收起指令' : '查看指令'}}</button></view>
  <text class="success-text" wx:if="{{copyStatus}}">{{copyStatus}}</text><text class="error" wx:if="{{copyError}}">{{copyError}}</text>
  <scroll-view class="instruction-box" wx:if="{{showAiInstruction}}" scroll-y><text selectable="true">{{aiInstruction}}</text></scroll-view>
  <textarea class="ai-reply-input" value="{{guideJson}}" data-field="guideJson" bindinput="onField" maxlength="40000" placeholder="在此粘贴AI返回的完整JSON，名称、介绍、提示词和选图指南将自动填入。" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading}}" />
  <button class="small-action" bindtap="onImportGuide" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading || !guideJson}}">{{importPending ? '替换填入' : '读取并填入'}}</button>
  <text class="success-text" wx:if="{{importStatus}}">{{importStatus}}</text><text class="error" wx:if="{{importError}}">{{importError}}</text>
 </view>
 <view class="form-card">
  <text class="section-title">2 · 上传实际效果封面</text><text class="hint">选择1–3张封面。JPEG / PNG / WebP，每张最多8MB；优先选择你实际生成的效果。</text>
  <view class="cover-grid"><view class="cover-card" wx:for="{{covers}}" wx:key="token"><image src="{{item.url}}" mode="aspectFit" lazy-load bindtap="onPreviewCover" data-url="{{item.url}}" /><button wx:if="{{!locked}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onRemoveCover" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">移除</button></view><button class="cover-add" wx:if="{{covers.length < 3 && !locked}}" bindtap="onChooseCover" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">＋ 选择封面</button></view>
 </view>
 <view class="form-card review-card">
  <view class="guide-heading"><text class="section-title">3 · 核对模板资料</text><button bindtap="onToggleDetails" disabled="{{loading}}">{{showDetails ? '收起' : (locked ? '展开查看' : '展开修改')}}</button></view>
  <text class="hint">读取后的内容仍可修改，也可以直接展开手动填写。提示词仅供后台审核和生成，不公开下发。</text>
  <view wx:if="{{!showDetails}}" class="template-summary"><text class="summary-name">{{name || '尚未填写模板名称'}}</text><text class="summary-subtitle">{{subtitle || '读取AI回复后，这里会显示效果介绍'}}</text><text class="summary-prompt">{{prompt ? '生成提示词：' + prompt : '生成提示词尚未填写'}}</text></view>
  <block wx:if="{{showDetails}}">
   <text class="field-label">模板名称</text><input value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="onField" maxlength="20" placeholder="例如：暖色旅行明信片" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading}}" />
   <text class="field-label">效果介绍</text><input value="{{subtitle}}" data-field="subtitle" bindinput="onField" maxlength="60" placeholder="一句话说明风格效果" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading}}" />
   <text class="field-label">生成提示词</text><textarea class="prompt-input" value="{{prompt}}" data-field="prompt" bindinput="onField" maxlength="4000" placeholder="核对AI是否完整保留了你的原始生成提示词" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading}}" />
   <text class="field-label">选图建议</text><textarea value="{{advice}}" data-field="advice" bindinput="onField" maxlength="500" placeholder="一段说明，建议不超过100字" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading}}" />
   <text class="field-label">适合哪些照片</text><textarea value="{{suitable}}" data-field="suitable" bindinput="onField" maxlength="500" placeholder="一行一条，例如单人人像、旅行风景" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading}}" />
   <text class="field-label">不太适合 · 可选</text><textarea value="{{unsuitable}}" data-field="unsuitable" bindinput="onField" maxlength="500" placeholder="只写实际确认的限制，一行一条" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading}}" />
   <text class="field-label">使用技巧 · 可选</text><textarea value="{{tips}}" data-field="tips" bindinput="onField" maxlength="500" placeholder="一行一条，可留空" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading}}" />
  </block>
 </view>
 <view class="reward-card"><text class="reward-title">{{rewardTitle}}</text><text class="reward-copy">{{rewardText}}</text><text class="reward-rules" wx:if="{{rewardRules}}">{{rewardRules}}</text><button wx:if="{{policyError}}" class="small-action" bindtap="loadPolicy" loading="{{policyLoading}}" disabled="{{policyLoading}}">重试读取奖励规则</button></view>
 <checkbox-group bindchange="onConsent"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="template" checked="{{consent}}" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading || importPending || !!importError}}" /><text>我已核对上述资料，有权分享封面与提示词，并同意审核后供其他用户创作使用。</text></label></checkbox-group>
 <text class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</text>
 <view class="form-actions"><button bindtap="onSaveDraft" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading}}">保存草稿</button><button class="primary" bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{busy || locked || loading || importPending || !!importError || !consent}}" loading="{{busy}}">提交后台审核</button></view>
 <view class="footer-links"><button bindtap="onMine">我的模板 · {{statusLabel}}</button><button bindtap="onLibrary">返回模板库</button></view>
</view>
